  "source_bytes": 344630,
  "inspected_reasoning": [
    "Authenticated original Decision selected propensity is exactly ProbabilityQ32::ONE; policy probabilities accept only 0 or 1,000,000 ppm.",
    "The OPE validator rejects any positive evaluated probability on a zero-behavior-support action and checks complete distributions.",
    "Both original arm policies are joined to the same authenticated target row, independently observed terminal Outcome and original principal cluster in assemble.",
    "For each supported deterministic row, the exact fixed-point weight is one: IPS/SNIPS use the same outcome, and DR = q + (outcome - q) = outcome. This is exact integer Q32 arithmetic under these restrictions, not a floating-point inference.",
    "The examined frozen task-success metric uses DoublyRobust PrimarySuperiority with minimum_improvement=0; conservative candidate.lower - baseline.upper cannot be strictly positive when both estimates are the same outcome average.",
    "This source-level finding does not generalize to a future provider or changed preregistered experiment; the current audit does not authorize changing the provider, propensity support, critic, goal or contract."
